{
    "title": "Screen Mirroring - TV Miracast",
    "description": "It\u2019s time to relax by enjoying a football match or watch videos on big screen with a screen mirroring app.\r\nDesigned to support a wide range of devices such as\r\n\u2705 All smart TVs\r\n\u2705 Wireless adapters\r\n\u2705 Brower website\r\n\u2705 And more\r\n\r\nThe screen-mirroring app allows you to search and connect to tv simply. Cast media to all smart TVs stable & smoothly. \r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddee <b>Main features of the screen-mirror app</b> \ud83e\uddee\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcbd <i>Screen Mirroring For TV</i> \ud83d\udcbd\r\nBring your content to life on a bigger screen. Our miracast screen mirroring app feature allows you to effortlessly display your device's screen on a larger display, such as a TV or projector.  Whether you're sharing presentations, videos, or photos, or simply sharing content with a larger audience. Immerse yourself in your device\u2019s screen in real time like never before.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcbd <i>TV Remote Control</i> \ud83d\udcbd\r\nTurn the phone into an smart remote control for TV with ease\r\n\u2714 Adjust volume, control channels, change navigation mode\u2026\r\n\u2714 Power on/off TV, menu button\r\n\u2714 Quick access to your favorite channels and apps on TV with 1 tap\r\nEnhances convenience and flexibility, enjoy total control from the palm of your hand.\r\n\r\n\ud83d\udcbd <i>Smart cast media to tv</i> \ud83d\udcbd\r\n\r\nShare your favorite media content effortlessly. Screen mirroring enables seamless media casting to your TV or other connected devices. \r\n\u2714 Stream web videos\r\n\u2714 View photos on smart TV\r\n\u2714 Play video games on TV\r\n\u2714 Web video cast\r\n\u2714 Web cast & video cast\r\n\u2714 Cast phone to TV\r\n\u2714 Cast video to TV\r\n\u2714 Any view cast to TV\r\n\u2714 Web video caster\r\n\u2714 Cast apps to smart tv\r\n\u2714 Read books, View documents on TV\r\nEnjoy the convenience of sharing and experiencing your media on a larger screen, immersing yourself in a captivating visual and audio experience.\r\n\r\n\ud83e\uddee What makes this smart screen share app stand out? \ud83e\uddee\r\n\r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Search & Connect with all devices quickly\r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Easy to use with simple operations\r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Multiple language support \r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Cast media to tv screen\r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Compatible with most of devices \r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Share screen with high-quality\r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Fast display phone screen on TV\r\n\ud83d\uddb2\ufe0f Real time screen mirroring \r\n\ud83e\uddee <b>How to use the smart remote app</b> \ud83e\uddee\r\n Follow these steps to bring experience for obvious view and vibrant sound\r\n\r\n\u2747\ufe0f Launching the smart tv cast app\r\n\u2747\ufe0f Make sure your phone/tablet and smart TV are connected to the same Wi-Fi network\r\n\u2747\ufe0f Enable wireless display on your phone\r\n\u2747\ufe0f Search & connect with your devices\r\n\u2747\ufe0f Enjoy watch videos on a big screen\r\n \r\nWhat are you waiting for? Look no further. Remote control for tv at your fingertips with our screen share with tv app. Cast video to your device's screen in real-time with high quality, ensuring a vibrant and eye-catching visual experience. \r\n\r\nIf you have any questions about your the cast to tv app, don\u2019t hesitate to contact us immediately. We will reply as soon as possible. Thank you for using the Screen Mirroring - TV Miracast app!",
